WEBVTT

1
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:18,940
Even for creatures as tenacious as human beings in the last days,

2
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,300
There is always a part that will survive strongly

3
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,690
I have been self-isolating at home for almost a month.

4
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:30,910
This is the first time I've been out racing.

5
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,990
The wind whizzes by my ears

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Not to mention how great this feeling is

7
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,510
I've been out for most of the day

8
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,710
It's time to get them some food.
